{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"nordic-frost","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Nordic Frost","description":"An arctic, north-bluish dark theme.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Nordic Frost","path":"themes/nordic-frost.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/nordic-frost.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Nordic Frost\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#2e3440\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#d8dee9\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#292e39\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#272c36\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#272c36\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#272c36\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#3b4252\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#434c5e\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#3b4252\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#292e39\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#232831\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#88c0d0\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#88c0d0\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#88c0d0\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#434c5e\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#3b425280\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#88c0d0\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#232831\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#bf616a\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#a3be8c\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#ebcb8b\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#bf616a\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#616e88\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a3be8c\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b48ead\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#81a1c1\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8fbcbb\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#88c0d0\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b48ead\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d8dee9\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#81a1c1\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8fbcbb\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d08770\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Nordic Frost\n\nAn arctic, north-bluish dark theme.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Nordic Frost** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nColors from the Nord palette (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#2e3440` |\n| Text | `#d8dee9` |\n| Accent | `#88c0d0` |\n| Keywords | `#81a1c1` |\n| Strings | `#a3be8c` |\n| Functions | `#88c0d0` |\n| Types | `#8fbcbb` |\n| Comments | `#616e88` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}